<title>INDONESIA: Semen Gresik 1996 net at 219.27 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Semen Gresik 1996 net at 219.27 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     219.27 vs 162.55</p>
<p>    Net income per share (rupiah)    369.66 vs 584.62</p>
<p>    Net sales			    1,362.96 vs 820.93</p>
<p>    Gross profit			   580.51 vs 354.11</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     321.55 vs 207.69</p>
<p>    Income before minority interest  223.75 vs 164.61</p>
<p>    Retained earnigns		    622.08 vs 467.83</p>
<p>Note : The results were audited. PT Semen Gresik is one of Indonesia's largest cement producers.</p>
</text>
